WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.133
Welcome to the
Man of Recaps, this is Reacher season one.

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:05.966
Meet Jack Reacher, an absolute
giant of a man.

00:00:05.966 --> 00:00:07.733
He's just come to Georgia
for some peach pie,

00:00:07.733 --> 00:00:10.300
but he's rudely interrupted
by being arrested.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.066
The Harvard-educated tweed-wearing Detective
Finlay fills him in,

00:00:13.066 --> 00:00:14.433
there was a murder late last night.

00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:17.166
Reacher is suspect number one
because he's a mysterious drifter

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:18.733
with no home address or possessions.

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:21.233
But it's soon obvious Reacher's innocent, he’s a retired war hero 

00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:23.266
who just came to town
because he loves blues music.

00:00:23.266 --> 00:00:25.266
In fact Reacher almost solves
the case immediately,

00:00:25.266 --> 00:00:29.200
he was a military investigator who's got
Sherlock-Holmes-like powers of deduction.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.033
The victim had a phone number
in his pocket, which leads them to this banker guy,

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:33.566
and when he sees a mysterious car watching him,

00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:36.500
he confesses to the murder,
even though he obviously didn't do it.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.100
Now Reacher's not free till his alibi clears,

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.033
so Finlay
forces him to help the investigation.

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:41.700
He and the banker spend the night in jail,

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.566
where he hopes
the banker will tell Reacher the truth.

00:00:43.566 --> 00:00:45.366
But whatever he's involved in
is real serious,

00:00:45.366 --> 00:00:47.300
as some inmates
were already hired to kill him.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.166
So Richard gives them
to the count of three.

00:00:49.166 --> 00:00:51.066
“One--” oh! Attacks immediately!

00:00:51.066 --> 00:00:53.333
That's his whole fighting strategy,
never hesitate.

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.600
Strike first, strike hard, Cobra Kai.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:56.866
Now that Reacher's alibi cleared,

00:00:56.866 --> 00:00:59.066
he’s picked up from jail by the hot cop Roscoe.

00:00:59.066 --> 00:01:00.833
He tells her about his wandering lifestyle,

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:02.533
he's not a “vagrant,” he’s a “hobo.”

00:01:02.533 --> 00:01:04.100
And he enjoys having no possessions,

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.566
whenever he needs to change a shirt, he just buys a new one.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:10.066
So Reacher's planning to mosey on,
until he learns he knows the victim...

00:01:10.066 --> 00:01:11.933
It is his brother Joe!

00:01:11.933 --> 00:01:14.366
And now the case gets bigger when the chief of police is murdered,

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:16.200
brutally nailed to the wall.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.066
Now they realize
there's a vast conspiracy,

00:01:18.066 --> 00:01:19.900
all the other cops are probably dirty,

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:21.700
Reacher's the only one they can trust.

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:24.466
First off, banker guy disappeared,
they got to protect his family,

00:01:24.466 --> 00:01:27.200
So Finlay calls in his FBI friend
who babysits them for the season.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:29.800
Their top suspect is Mr. Kleiner, the rich guy in town,

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:31.866
who seems real good and is obviously bad.

00:01:31.866 --> 00:01:34.866
Especially because his son, K.J., has been threatening Reacher,

00:01:34.866 --> 00:01:37.500
even though Reacher could crush his head with one hand.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.366
So they interview Kleiner
but can't find anything,

00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:41.566
the only thing
suspicious is all the cow feed he ordered,

00:01:41.566 --> 00:01:43.966
“A hell of a lot of cow feed”
for not that many cows.

00:01:43.966 --> 00:01:47.133
So Reacher keeps investigating,
which mostly entails beating people up.

00:01:47.133 --> 00:01:48.766
He starts hanging out with Officer Roscoe,

00:01:48.766 --> 00:01:52.333
who hooks him up with her uncle's gun,
an absolutely massive Desert Eagle.

00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:55.033
When the bad guys break into her house
she and Reacher go hide in a motel,

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:59.000
where they start to fall in love,
and pretty soon... get it on!

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.733
The case keeps getting more complex,

00:02:00.733 --> 00:02:04.133
what are professional Venezuelan hitmen doing in this small Georgia town?

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:06.000
So Reacher gets help from his old friend
Neagley,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.566
who was in his Special Investigators
unit back in the military.

00:02:08.566 --> 00:02:10.433
Now somehow
related is the river pollution,

00:02:10.433 --> 00:02:13.833
and when a dirty cop captures them, Reacher and Neagley get to see the river real close up.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.866
And now Reacher has to change his shirt
again.

00:02:15.866 --> 00:02:18.100
Now Reacher’s brother Joe worked for the Secret Service,

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.033
and when they talk
to his coworker-slash-girlfriend,

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:22.266
they learn
he was investigating counterfeiting.

00:02:22.266 --> 00:02:23.700
She comes to town to give them the files,

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.566
but no! The bad guys kill her too.

00:02:25.566 --> 00:02:27.500
In New York Reacher talks
to the counterfeiting expert,

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.733
who tells him
it's the paper that you just can't fake.

00:02:29.733 --> 00:02:33.466
But the bad guys have goons here too, so Reacher kills this guy with his necktie,

00:02:33.466 --> 00:02:35.166
then has to change his shirt again.

00:02:35.166 --> 00:02:38.266
So it's starting to come together: Mr. Kleiner is running a vast
counterfeiting network

00:02:38.266 --> 00:02:40.300
where they're shipping
fake money down to Venezuela.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.133
But when Finlay goes to his office
to find evidence,

00:02:42.133 --> 00:02:45.533
Oh! Mr. Kleiner was already killed! He wasn’t the top dog.

00:02:45.533 --> 00:02:48.433
So Reacher lays a trap
by telling one of the corrupt cops where he’s going to be,

00:02:48.433 --> 00:02:50.000
then he goes into commando mode,

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.633
so when the hit squad comes for him, Reacher's doing the hitting.

00:02:52.633 --> 00:02:54.566
But during the fight
Reacher got knocked into the pool,

00:02:54.566 --> 00:02:56.233
and now his notepaper is all faded.

00:02:56.233 --> 00:02:59.033
And that's the final puzzle piece,
how are they getting the money paper?

00:02:59.033 --> 00:03:00.700
They're just using one dollar bills!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.633
Washing the ink off,
then reprinting them as hundreds.

00:03:03.633 --> 00:03:06.866
And that's what all the cattle feed was
for, using it to dry the paper.

00:03:06.866 --> 00:03:08.433
But the bad guys are one step ahead,

00:03:08.433 --> 00:03:11.233
because Finlay's FBI friend was in on it the whole time!

00:03:11.233 --> 00:03:13.000
And it's Kleiner Jr who killed his dad

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.533
and took over the operation,
because he's a little psychopath.

00:03:15.533 --> 00:03:17.466
But they're not killing Reacher yet, they need his help

00:03:17.466 --> 00:03:20.500
to find the banker guy, who they didn't kill, he’s in hiding.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.933
But Reacher sneakily grabs
a fork to pop the tire, 

00:03:22.933 --> 00:03:25.033
then in the trunk, grabs a gun and gets away.

00:03:25.033 --> 00:03:27.566
Then the time for subtlety is over,
as Reacher and friends

00:03:27.566 --> 00:03:30.100
attack the warehouse
and go in guns blazing!

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.633
In the final showdown with K.J.,

00:03:31.633 --> 00:03:34.566
he's distracted
monologuing about hunting a rhinoceros.

00:03:34.566 --> 00:03:37.400
So Reacher just grabs
this punk, throws him in the fire!

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.266
Avenges his brother, and the day is saved.

00:03:40.266 --> 00:03:42.433
Now Reacher
and Roscoe have fallen in love,

00:03:42.433 --> 00:03:44.966
but he can't stick around, he's
got to keep wandering.

00:03:44.966 --> 00:03:47.900
And she's like “Yeah, I figured. This
kind of seems like a James Bond thing...”

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:50.333
“where you have a new hot
girlfriend every season.”

00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:53.966
So Reacher finally gets his peach pie,
then leaves town for his next adventure.

00:03:53.966 --> 00:03:57.066
And that's
where Reacher season one comes to an end.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:00.100
If you liked this recap, hit that subscribe button,

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:03.233
for more of the best recaps of TV and movies.

